{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act43side_level_act43side_st02",
  "groupId": "act43side",
  "stageId": "act43side_st02",
  "title": "焦点",
  "storyCode": "AD-ST-2",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act43side/level_act43side_st02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b1624c4468845c1021662fd96f944c3b35cee6a5c782dd661f1fb932573d2837",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人员A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂喂，你也看到迈克尔和玛丽昂的尸体了，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人员B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎哟，我好不容易才把那个恐怖的景象从脑子里面赶出去，你怎么又说起来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人员B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我、我的手都在抖，感觉要握不住录音杆了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人员A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你怎么还想着工作！我们现在待着的地方真的有一个连环杀人魔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人员B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我们赶紧逃吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人员A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "逃？你忘了迈克尔和玛丽昂是为什么被凶手盯上的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人员A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "迈克尔的脚下还放着行李，听说他做了充足的准备，找到了私下开溜的路子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人员A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但他还是在离开这个地块的前一刻被找上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人员A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那个凶手不会让任何人离开的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人员A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就像《开膛黎博利杰克》一样，这里是他的猎场，我们每个人都可能是他的猎物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摄影助理",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿布纳，你多久没检查胸架了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摄影助理",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看，升降臂这边的几个螺丝都已经松了，一个不小心，摄影机就得在地上砸个粉碎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "碎了就碎了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摄影助理",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我帮你保养下这几组镜头吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摄影助理",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我是你的助理，阿布纳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别以为我不知道你献殷勤是为了什么——滚远点，小子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摄影助理",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "道尔顿的死不是意外，对不对？还有谢莉、迈克尔和玛丽昂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摄影助理",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "凶手不可能是无差别杀人，所有的受害者，都和五年前的那起意外有关。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你该去当娱乐记者，而不是摄影助理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摄影助理",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不矛盾啦，前者更好讨生活......阿布纳，我的好阿布纳，五年前你也在，反正现在有时间，你就跟我说说嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "米兰妮女士，这会儿没有您的戏......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我难道能安心继续在房间里研究“杜邦夫人”死前的妆造？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这关系到结尾那几场高潮戏，抱歉，我还没有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，你的神迟到了。但我现在没有心情责怪你和你的神，亲爱的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "发生了这么大的事，如果不是离主城区太远，蓝卡坞的警察这会儿已经封锁整个地块，项目也早已停工......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然，现在的情况也没有好到哪儿去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "斯蒂芬，我开始担心自己的投资要血本无归了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这几天发生的事情，你知道多少隐情？格蕾塔知道多少？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人员C",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "斯蒂芬导演，米兰妮女士，原来二位也在啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人员C",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "制片人呢？格蕾塔应该给所有人一个说法！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "窃窃私语。\n到处都是窃窃私语的声音，整个摄影棚内，没有一个人在工作。\n三起命案、四个死者，接二连三的变故摧毁了这些人的状态，恐慌、愤怒、困惑、无所适从......整个剧组在失控的边缘。\n真吵啊，吵得人心里乱糟糟的。她讨厌这种感觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "格蕾塔径直走向摄影棚的中央，她打开了最亮的那盏场灯，刺目的光亮逼停了每一个人的动作和话头，人们注意到了她。\n格蕾塔深深呼吸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "各位，我要宣布一些事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不是演员，台词功底没那么好，听不清的往我这边靠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人员们",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "几分钟后，各位可以查看自己在蓝卡坞的专属金融终端。来之前，我已经委托财务，付清了剧组每一位成员酬劳的尾款。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然，道尔顿、谢莉、迈克尔、玛丽昂，除了为这几位朋友结算应得的酬劳之外，还会给他们的家属发放抚恤金，我事后会专门处理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是的，《杜邦夫人之死》的拍摄还没有结束，合同还有效力，我本不需要这么做——但毕竟，已经没几个人的心思还在工作上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘿，格蕾塔，这不像你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "剧组只不过是出了一些......不算小的意外，还没到放弃的时候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还是说，经历这些事情之后，作为制片人，你已经对电影最后的质量不抱任何信心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放弃？亲爱的，你想多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我从不怀疑自己的眼光，自然也谈不上会放弃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是你现在......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我给大家讲个故事吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "喂，小子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摄影助理",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "格蕾塔女士，您是在叫我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "拿出你的录音笔、笔记本、速记终端......随便什么，然后坐好，用心听。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摄影助理",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什、什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别再让我看到你那些偷偷摸摸的小动作，我接下来说的所有事情，你都可以光明正大地记下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你也可以去找《特里蒙娱乐周刊》《蓝卡坞咖啡时间》《多面人物》......我个人不会以任何方式对你进行追责，只要你能把消息带出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "无论对你来说，出卖消息换取的是奖赏，还是，惩罚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摄影助理",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“蓝卡坞学院奖”，想必在场的每一个人都熟悉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "蓝卡坞面向新人的专业奖项，每年都有无数的影视学院学生、电影爱好者向它投去稿件，想尽办法证明自己多么懂创作多么懂市场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们渴望作品能入选，因为哪怕只是拿到最末的奖项，也意味着自己得到了进入蓝卡坞的资格......有个斐迪亚也不例外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她自认眼光不凡，有想法也有毅力，自信哪怕暂时只能挤在出租屋里，也终会站在蓝卡坞发布会的红毯上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "终于，她等来了最好的故事，找到了最好的搭档，她攒起团队，把那个故事拍了出来，寄了出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可这个小地方来的家伙太渴望自己能成功了，更何况此刻身上还背负着所有同伴的信任......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "评选结束的倒计时越近，她的渴望越深，对自己作品的怀疑反而越强烈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她说不清自己怎么就动了歪心思，她求遍亲友，凑了一笔巨款——对当时的她来说......然后，她敲开了那些评委的门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摄影助理",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么听着这么熟悉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“学院奖”揭晓的当天，组委会公开了斐迪亚的所作所为，向全泰拉的观众证明了蓝卡坞的专业与纯洁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而那个斐迪亚呢，她投稿的作品被取消评奖资格，团队的所有成员与她决裂，她失去了一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摄影助理",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想起来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摄影助理",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这件事超级讽刺！根据组委会后来披露的资料......那个作品本来已经拿到了最高票，是最受评委们瞩目的作品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "后来，那个家伙用了十年的时间，穷尽一切办法才重回蓝卡坞，慢慢地，也做出了些成绩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然，她给自己改了名......格蕾塔·斯通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摄影助理",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "米兰妮，现在你明白了，我是个极其愚蠢的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我主动向命运讨要了一个玩笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好在，这段说来我自己都倍感荒唐的经历教会了我一件事——我不该怀疑自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我相信我自己的眼光，我不会放弃我想做的任何事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，你比我想象中稍微有意思了那么一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说实话，我一直以为你身上那股子自以为是的劲，是故意装出来唬人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "得了吧，格蕾塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你突然搞这么一出，又说起这么个没头没尾的故事，不就是为了博取我们的同情......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们站的地方在死人，我们的前面有天灾......发生了这么多的事，你还想让我们继续为你卖命？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道你一直对我耿耿于怀，阿布纳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......从五年前开始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我可不敢。毕竟，我可是靠着那部电影里的经典镜头，拿到了当年蓝卡坞最佳摄影奖......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那可是一个电影摄影师能拿到的最高荣誉......你赏赐给我的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可在那之后呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "明明达到了职业生涯的巅峰，却自暴自弃，短短半年后就没人敢再请你掌镜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "曾经你那么疼爱自己手里的摄影机，如今却像对待空了的薯片袋子一样对待它们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "进《杜邦夫人之死》这个剧组之前，你甚至在赌场里输掉了跟了自己十几年的老伙计，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你憎恨五年前的那部电影，你憎恨那个让你获奖的画面，你憎恨当时让你把它保留下来的我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没错！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的摄影机偶然拍下了那个叫劳拉的女孩从高空坠落的画面，我当时看到你的表情时就知道你没安什么好心......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我警告过你很多次，可你还是强行将那个画面剪进了电影里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "影评人们越是夸那个镜头多么真实多么震撼，我就越觉得可笑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "电影是造梦的艺术，摄影机是造梦的手和看梦的眼睛，你侮辱了那个女孩子，你侮辱了我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我讨厌我手里的这些机器，我讨厌我的工作，你明白吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿布纳，既然如此，放下它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很抱歉我们跑题了，让我们言归正传——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "确认酬劳到账后，各位可以随时离开剧组。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想要赶紧逃离这个危险重重的地块的，请自便；害怕连环杀人犯想要找个地方躲着的，请自便......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "出于种种目的想要充当侦探的，请自便；甚至那个还不愿意放弃复仇的凶手，也请自便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "《杜邦夫人之死》绝大多数的拍摄工作已经完成，只剩下最后这两天，只剩下最后几场高潮戏......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还愿意留下来的人，或许我们依然可以把它拍完。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至于缺了摄影师......我会顶上阿布纳的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿布纳",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "摄影助理",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "米兰妮？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "毕竟我没办法临时变出另一个“杜邦夫人”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道的，我没有选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我还指望凭着这部电影打败玛丽安娜呢，格蕾塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "灾难，难道不是另一种形式的眷顾吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "玛丽安娜已经息影多年了，真不知道你对她哪儿来这么大的执念。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这就不用你过问了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但丑话说在前面，人都跑光之后，你在意的那些女主演的待遇、片场的规矩......可就顾不上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米兰妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "斯蒂芬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道我知道，我会今天晚上就把结局修改出来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我相信我拍下这个故事时的判断，亲爱的，这几天，你也已经思考够多积累够多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天灾近在咫尺，死亡就在眼前......你的神难道不爱这些素材吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯蒂芬",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "感谢各位这段时间的付出，祝大家好运。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾塔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想说的就是这些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
